/apps/2349820/extras/9c44af419c50833aa315912ae9c5f889.poster.avif?t=1770341966\" width=618 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349820/extras/9c44af419c50833aa315912ae9c5f889.webm?t=1770341966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349820/extras/9c44af419c50833aa315912ae9c5f889.mp4?t=1770341966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the action with our game's rich lineup of PVP events, from battle royales to guild wars. Tailor your inventory on the fly with various weapons and gear to suit every twist and turn of battles. Leverage unique buildings like Boost Pads, Sentries, Traps, and more to outmaneuver opponents. Create your combination of survival and destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349820/extras/662db769d29e3d8c09f03a50268fec97.poster.avif?t=1770341966\" width=618 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349820/extras/662db769d29e3d8c09f03a50268fec97.webm?t=1770341966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349820/extras/662db769d29e3d8c09f03a50268fec97.mp4?t=1770341966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up in dungeon raids and other engaging game modes, or ally with friends to build a guild and reign supreme. Plus, bring up to three pets, each with unique skills, to bolster your strength and strategy on every adventure.</p>","developers":["\u94a2\u4e4b\u76f4\u7537\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RP